STEP 2 -- SHRUG PUBLIC-WATER OUTCOMES (1991 / 2001 / 2011)

------------------------------------------------------------------------------
DEVIATION FROM PHASE0_SPEC.md -- PENDING PI APPROVAL
------------------------------------------------------------------------------
PHASE0_SPEC.md 3.3 anchors the missingness rule on pc91_vd_drnk_wat_f.
That flag exists ONLY in 1991. SHRUG v2.2 ships no 2001 or 2011 analogue.

This script CONSTRUCTS a year-specific anchor for 2001 and 2011:
  2001: anchor non-missing <=> all 10 pc01_vd_<source> non-missing;
        drnk_wat_f01 = 1{any source > 0}
  2011: anchor non-missing <=> all 10 pc11_vd_wat_<source> non-missing;
        drnk_wat_f11 = 1{any source == 1}

This construction is NOT in the spec. Every Phase 0 result that uses a
2001 or 2011 anchor is PROVISIONAL until the PI approves it.
  [OK]   vd91: shrid2 is character
  [OK]   vd01: shrid2 is character
  [OK]   vd11: shrid2 is character

